#: templates/main/about.html:35
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Hello! I’m Shukhrat Jamolov, a 31-year-old Full Stack Python Developer "
#| "with a strong passion for\n"
#| "            solving real-world problems through clean and efficient code. "
#| "Since 2018, I’ve been working at\n"
#| "            United Distribution as a 1C Database Operator, where I manage "
#| "and maintain critical business data.\n"
#| "            My goal is to continuously grow as a developer and contribute "
#| "to impactful, tech-driven solutions.\n"
#| "            "
msgid ""
"\n"
"            Hello! I’m Shukhrat Jamolov, a 31-year-old Full Stack Python "
"Developer with a strong passion for\n"
"            solving real-world problems through clean and efficient code. "
"Since 2018, I’ve been working at\n"
"            United Distribution as a 1C Database Operator, where I manage "
"and maintain critical business data.\n"
"            My goal is to continuously grow as a developer and contribute to "
"impactful, tech-driven solutions.\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"Salom! Men Shukhrat Jamolovman, 31 yoshdaman va Full Stack Python "
"dasturchisiman. Haqiqiy hayotdagi muammolarni toza va samarali kod orqali "
"hal qilish ishtiyoqmandiman. 2018-yildan buyon United Distribution "
"kompaniyasida 1C ma’lumotlar bazasi operatori sifatida ishlayman,bu yerda "
"men muhim biznes ma’lumotlarini boshqaraman va yangilab boraman. Maqsadim – "
"dasturchi sifatida doimiy o‘sish va texnologiyaga asoslangan samarali "
"yechimlarga o‘z hissamni qo‘shish."

#: templates/main/about.html:44
msgid ""
"I began my programming journey in 2018 by completing a Frontend Development "
"course at Proweb Academy.\n"
"            Later, in 2024, I strengthened my skills by graduating from the "
"Full Stack Python Developer course\n"
"            at Bobir Akilkhanov Academy. My technical expertise includes "
"Python, Django, MySQL, as well as HTML,\n"
"            CSS, and JavaScript."
msgstr ""
"Men dasturlash yo‘limni 2018-yilda Proweb Academy’da Frontend Development "
"kursini tamomlash bilan boshlaganman. Keyinchalik, 2024-yilda Bobir "
"Akilkhanov Academy’da Full Stack Python Developer kursini tugatib, o‘z bilim "
"va ko‘nikmalarimni yanada mustahkamladim. Texnik bilimlarim Python, Django, "
"MySQL, shuningdek HTML, CSS va JavaScript texnologiyalarini o‘z ichiga oladi."

#: templates/main/about.html:50
msgid ""
"I am committed to establishing myself in the field of Data Science by "
"mastering deep analytics and\n"
"            machine learning technologies to solve real-world problems. In "
"2025, I plan to dive deeper into this\n"
"            field and expand my knowledge and skills."
msgstr ""
"Men muammolarini hal qilish uchun chuqur analitika va mashina o‘rganish "
"texnologiyalarini o‘zlashtirib, Data Science sohasida o‘z o‘rnimni "
"egallashga intilaman. 2025 yilda men bu sohada yanada chuqurroq bilim olish "
"va ko‘nikmalarimni kengaytirishni rejalashtiryapman."

